## 📝 Response Format

### Success Response
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "Operation successful",
  "data": { ... }
}
```

### Error Response
```json
{
  "success": false,
  "message": "Error description",
  "errors": {
    "field": ["Error message"]
  }
}
```

### Pagination
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "data": {
    "data": [...],
    "current_page": 1,
    "last_page": 5,
    "per_page": 20,
    "total": 100
  }
}
```

