## 🚀 Frontend Integration

### JavaScript Example
```javascript
// Get all staff
const staff = await fetch('/api/staff', {
  headers: { 'Authorization': `Bearer ${token}` }
}).then(r => r.json());

// Mark attendance
const attendance = await fetch('/api/attendances', {
  method: 'POST',
  headers: {
    'Content-Type': 'application/json',
    'Authorization': `Bearer ${token}`
  },
  body: JSON.stringify({
    user_id: 1,
    status: 'present',
    remarks: 'On time'
  })
}).then(r => r.json());

// Generate monthly payments
const payments = await fetch('/api/salary-payments/generate-monthly', {
  method: 'POST',
  headers: {
    'Content-Type': 'application/json', 
    'Authorization': `Bearer ${token}`
  },
  body: JSON.stringify({
    month: '2025-01-01',
    notes: 'January salaries'
  })
}).then(r => r.json());
```

