## 📊 Status Values

### Attendance Status
- `present` - Present
- `absent` - Absent  
- `late` - Late arrival
- `half-day` - Half day

### Payment Status
- `pending` - Not yet paid
- `paid` - Payment completed

### User Types
- `admin` - Administrator
- `staff` - Staff member

### Salary Types
- `fixed` - Fixed monthly salary
- `commission` - Commission-based salary
